description = "Your censer's chain lengthens and sweeps a full circle, dealing {hit} Holy damage with {threat}x threat to all enemies within {radius} m. Gives {b:HALLOWED_ARC_INCENSE} Incense for each enemy hit and knocks a mote of light loose from each, up to {b:HALLOWED_ARC_MOTES}. Full damage to up to {b:AOE_TARGET_CAP} enemies; with more, that damage is split evenly between all of them."
